<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- Quantum HTML + CSS example 20_components/15: Timeline -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Timeline</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1f2933;
      background: #f5f7fa;
    }
    .demo { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
    .demo > h1 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 2rem; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 2rem; color: #52606d; }

    .timeline { list-style: none; padding: 0 0 0 1.5rem; border-left: 3px solid #c7d2fe; }
    .timeline li { position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .timeline li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -2.15rem; top: 0.25rem; width: 1rem; height: 1rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #6366f1; border: 3px solid #f5f7fa; }
    .timeline time { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6366f1; font-weight: 700; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="demo">
    <h1>Timeline</h1>
    <p class="lead">Events along a vertical line.</p>
    <ol class="timeline">
      <li><time datetime="1991">1991</time><p>The first web page goes online.</p></li>
      <li><time datetime="1996">1996</time><p>CSS level 1 becomes a recommendation.</p></li>
      <li><time datetime="2014">2014</time><p>HTML5 is finished.</p></li>
      <li><time datetime="2026">2026</time><p>Quantum compiles HTML and CSS.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
